{
  "accent": "#f2b04a",
  "gap": 0.7,
  "scene_module": "scenes_ibrahim",
  "chapters": [
    {
      "title": null,
      "scene": "fire0",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 2,
          "q": "21:69",
          "w": [
            2,
            7
          ],
          "en": "O fire, be coolness and safety upon Abraham"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "4:125",
          "w": [
            14,
            17
          ],
          "en": "And Allah took Abraham as an intimate friend"
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "title": "The Friend of Allah",
          "sub": "The Story of Prophet Ibrahim (AS)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "A Boy Among Idols",
      "scene": "idoltown",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "6:74",
          "w": [
            6,
            14
          ],
          "en": "Do you take idols as deities? Indeed, I see you and your people to be in manifest error"
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "q": "21:51",
          "w": [
            1,
            7
          ],
          "en": "And We had certainly given Abraham his sound judgement before"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Star, the Moon and the Sun",
      "scene": "sky",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "q": "6:76",
          "w": [
            13,
            15
          ],
          "en": "I like not those that disappear"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "q": "6:79",
          "w": [
            1,
            12
          ],
          "en": "Indeed, I have turned my face toward He who created the heavens and the earth, inclining toward truth, and I am not of those who associate others with Allah"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "O My Father",
      "scene": "home",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "q": "19:42",
          "w": [
            4,
            15
          ],
          "en": "O my father, why do you worship that which does not hear and does not see and will not benefit you at all"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "q": "19:46",
          "w": [
            2,
            10
          ],
          "en": "Have you no desire for my gods, O Abraham? If you do not desist, I will surely stone you"
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "q": "19:47",
          "w": [
            2,
            10
          ],
          "en": "Peace will be upon you. I will ask forgiveness for you of my Lord. Indeed, He is ever gracious to me"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Broken Idols",
      "scene": "temple",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "q": "21:52",
          "w": [
            5,
            11
          ],
          "en": "What are these statues to which you are devoted"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "21:58",
          "w": [
            1,
            5
          ],
          "en": "So he made them into fragments, except a large one among them"
        },
        {
          "line": 7,
          "q": "21:63",
          "w": [
            2,
            9
          ],
          "en": "Rather, this - the largest of them - did it, so ask them, if they should [be able to] speak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Fire",
      "scene": "pyre",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "q": "21:68",
          "w": [
            2,
            7
          ],
          "en": "Burn him and support your gods - if you are to act"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "21:69",
          "w": [
            2,
            7
          ],
          "en": "O fire, be coolness and safety upon Abraham"
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "q": "21:70",
          "w": [
            1,
            5
          ],
          "en": "And they intended for him harm, but We made them the greatest losers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The King Who Argued",
      "scene": "court",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "2:258",
          "w": [
            26,
            35
          ],
          "en": "Indeed, Allah brings up the sun from the east, so bring it up from the west"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "q": "2:258",
          "w": [
            36,
            38
          ],
          "en": "So the disbeliever was overwhelmed [by astonishment]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Leaving Home",
      "scene": "journey",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 3,
          "q": "37:99",
          "w": [
            2,
            6
          ],
          "en": "Indeed, I will go to [where I am ordered by] my Lord; He will guide me"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "q": "37:100",
          "w": [
            1,
            5
          ],
          "en": "My Lord, grant me [a child] from among the righteous"
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "q": "37:101",
          "w": [
            1,
            3
          ],
          "en": "So We gave him good tidings of a forbearing boy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Valley Without Water",
      "scene": "valley",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 2,
          "text": "“Then He will not abandon us.”",
          "ref": "Sahih al-Bukhari 3364"
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "q": "14:37",
          "w": [
            1,
            15
          ],
          "en": "Our Lord, I have settled some of my descendants in an uncultivated valley near Your sacred House, our Lord, that they may establish prayer"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "text": "The spring of *Zamzam*",
          "ref": "Sahih al-Bukhari 3364"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Show Me How",
      "scene": "hills",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "q": "2:260",
          "w": [
            4,
            8
          ],
          "en": "My Lord, show me how You give life to the dead"
        },
        {
          "line": 2,
          "q": "2:260",
          "w": [
            13,
            16
          ],
          "en": "Yes, but [I ask] only that my heart may be satisfied"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Dream",
      "scene": "mina",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 2,
          "q": "37:102",
          "w": [
            6,
            15
          ],
          "en": "O my son, indeed I have seen in a dream that I [must] sacrifice you, so see what you think"
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "q": "37:102",
          "w": [
            17,
            26
          ],
          "en": "O my father, do as you are commanded. You will find me, if Allah wills, of the steadfast"
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "q": "37:107",
          "w": [
            1,
            3
          ],
          "en": "And We ransomed him with a great sacrifice"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Honoured Guests",
      "scene": "tent",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "q": "51:24",
          "w": [
            1,
            6
          ],
          "en": "Has there reached you the story of the honored guests of Abraham"
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "q": "51:27",
          "w": [
            3,
            5
          ],
          "en": "Will you not eat"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "q": "11:71",
          "w": [
            4,
            9
          ],
          "en": "Then We gave her good tidings of Isaac and after Isaac, Jacob"
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "q": "11:73",
          "w": [
            1,
            11
          ],
          "en": "Are you amazed at the decree of Allah? May the mercy of Allah and His blessings be upon you, people of the house"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The House",
      "scene": "kaaba",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 2,
          "q": "2:127",
          "w": [
            8,
            14
          ],
          "en": "Our Lord, accept [this] from us. Indeed You are the Hearing, the Knowing"
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "q": "2:128",
          "w": [
            1,
            9
          ],
          "en": "Our Lord, and make us Muslims [in submission] to You and from our descendants a Muslim nation [in submission] to You"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "q": "22:27",
          "w": [
            1,
            14
          ],
          "en": "And proclaim to the people the Hajj [pilgrimage]; they will come to you on foot and on every lean camel; they will come from every distant pass"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Dua of Ibrahim",
      "scene": "makkah",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "q": "14:35",
          "w": [
            4,
            13
          ],
          "en": "My Lord, make this city [Makkah] secure and keep me and my sons away from worshipping idols"
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "q": "14:40",
          "w": [
            1,
            9
          ],
          "en": "My Lord, make me an establisher of prayer, and [many] from my descendants. Our Lord, and accept my supplication"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "14:41",
          "w": [
            1,
            8
          ],
          "en": "Our Lord, forgive me and my parents and the believers the Day the account is established"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Lesson",
      "scene": "lesson3",
      "cards": [
        {
          "line": 2,
          "q": "60:4",
          "w": [
            1,
            7
          ],
          "en": "There has already been for you an excellent pattern in Abraham"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "q": "37:109",
          "w": [
            1,
            3
          ],
          "en": "Peace upon Abraham"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
